OL,3,GNEWSAYoung Chef of the Year finalist
OL,4,Ainspired by dad
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young chef has reached the final of
OL,7,Fone of the UK's most prestigious
OL,8,Fculinary competitions.
OL,10,FEno West, a commis chef at the
OL,11,FMichelin-starred Northcote in the
OL,12,FRibble Valley, is one of the finalists
OL,13,Ffor the Young National Chef of the Year
OL,14,Ftitle.
OL,16,FThe competition is designed to showcase
OL,17,Fthe next generation of talent and
OL,18,Foffers the chance for young chefs to
OL,19,Ftest their skills, gain experience and
OL,20,Fearn national recognition early in
OL,21,Ftheir careers.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
